[2026-03-04T20:21:48.782Z] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01ALik6xz67mJ347Q8RBhGRi","type":"tool_result","content":"<persisted-output>\nOutput too large (198KB). Full output saved to: /home/agent/.claude/projects/-repo/3e708823-920f-43f5-b295-766b5a5c6f26/tool-results/bp5ysmf4q.txt\n\nPreview (first 2KB):\n/repo/logs/worker-app-building-gu9tow-5-2026-03-04T20-06-56-015Z.log:[2026-03-04T20:05:58.353Z] {\"type\":\"user\",\"message\":{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"tool_use_id\":\"toolu_01UyNLbS19pnKA67gSDXPsRc\",\"type\":\"tool_result\",\"content\":\"     1→# Skill\\n     2→\\n     3→You are writing the database and code for the app to match the specs in AppSpec.md and docs/tests.md, and to match an optional style guide. If `AppRevisions.md` exists, it describes new functionality and spec changes organized by topic section, and must also be followed.\\n     4→\\n     5→## Unpack Subtasks\\n     6→\\n     7→Unpack the initial write app task into subtasks using `add-task`:\\n     8→\\n     9→First, add a setup task:\\n    10→```\\n    11→npx tsx /repo/scripts/add-task.ts --skill \\\"skills/tasks/build/writeApp.md\\\" --app \\\"<AppName>\\\" \\\\\\n    12→  --subtask \\\"SetupApp: Setup the app\\\" \\\\\\n    13→  --subtask \\\"DesignDatabase: Design the database\\\"\\n    14→```\\n    15→\\n    16→Then add one task per page, containing all components and the page itself:\\n    17→```\\n    18→npx tsx /repo/scripts/add-task.ts --skill \\\"skills/tasks/build/writeApp.md\\\" --app \\\"<AppName>\\\" \\\\\\n    19→  --subtask \\\"WriteComponent<Component1>: Write the <Component1> component\\\" \\\\\\n    20→  --subtask \\\"WriteComponent<Component2>: Write the <Component2> component\\\" \\\\\\n    21→  --subtask \\\"WritePage<Name>: Write the page itself\\\"\\n    22→```\\n    23→\\n    24→## Guidelines\\n    25→\\n    26→- Write clean, working code. No TODOs, placeholder implementations, or mock data. All features must be real and fully functional end-to-end, backed by the database.\\n    27→- All JSX rendered on a page must be abstracted into other React components with their own files.\\n    28→- Check for style guides at both `apps/AppStyle.md` (shared across all apps) and `apps/<AppName>/AppStyle.md` (app-specific). Read both if they exist and use them to style the pages and components appropriately. The app-specific style guide takes precedence when they conflic\n...\n</persisted-output>","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01BpZQ7ru5ReeTrZZBiaxgTP","session_id":"3e708823-920f-43f5-b295-766b5a5c6f26","uuid":"a5b73d09-602e-429f-acef-075eb1a3c566"}
