[2026-03-04T20:22:34.774Z] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01BpZQ7ru5ReeTrZZBiaxgTP","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! Now I have all the information needed. Let me provide you with a comprehensive summary of the project structure.\n\n---\n\n## Project Structure Analysis for Todo App Testing\n\nBased on my thorough exploration of the repository, here's a complete breakdown of the existing project structure relevant to implementing a test script:\n\n### 1. Scripts Directory Structure\n\n**Root Scripts** (`/repo/scripts/`):\n- **`add-task.ts`** - Task queue management script that:\n  - Adds tasks to a queue file (`/repo/tasks/tasks-{CONTAINER_NAME}.json`)\n  - Uses command-line arguments: `--skill`, `--subtask`, `--app`\n  - Manages task ordering (newest tasks added to the front)\n  - Used by: `npm run add-task` in root package.json\n\n**App Scripts** (`/repo/apps/todo-app/scripts/`):\n- **`schema.ts`** - Database initialization:\n  - Uses `@neondatabase/serverless` neon() client\n  - Creates `todos` table with fields: id (UUID), title, completed, priority, due_date, notes, created_at, updated_at\n  - Creates two indexes: idx_todos_created_at, idx_todos_completed\n  - Exported function: `initSchema(databaseUrl: string)`\n\n- **`check.ts`** - Type checking and linting:\n  - Runs `npx tsc --noEmit` for TypeScript validation\n  - Runs `npx eslint . --fix` for linting\n  - Outputs to `logs/check.log`\n  - Exit code: 0 on success, 1 on failure\n\n### 2. Package.json Configuration\n\n**Root** (`/repo/package.json`):\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"app-building\",\n  \"type\": \"module\",\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"agent\": \"tsx src/agent.ts\",\n    \"add-task\": \"tsx scripts/add-task.ts\",\n    \"status\": \"tsx src/status.ts\",\n    \"read-log\": \"tsx src/read-log.ts\"\n  },\n  \"devDependencies\": {\n    \"tsx\": \"^4.19.0\",\n    \"typescript\": \"^5.5.0\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**Todo App** (`/repo/apps/todo-app/package.json`):\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"todo-app\",\n  \"type\": \"module\",\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"dev\": \"vite\",\n    \"build\": \"tsc -b && vite build\",\n    \"lint\": \"eslint .\",\n    \"preview\": \"vite preview\",\n    \"check\": \"tsx scripts/check.ts\"\n  },\n  \"devDependencies\": {\n    \"tsx\": \"^4.21.0\",\n    \"vite\": \"^7.3.1\",\n    \"tailwindcss\": \"^4.2.1\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### 3. Database Configuration\n\n**Environment Variables Required**:\n- `DATABASE_URL` - Neon database connection string (from `.env`, referenced in `/repo/apps/todo-app/netlify/functions/db.ts`)\n- `NEON_PROJECT_ID` - Neon project identifier (referenced in test documentation)\n- `NEON_API_KEY` - For Neon branch management (required for ephemeral test branches)\n- `RECORD_REPLAY_API_KEY` - For Replay recording uploads (already set in container)\n\n**Database Client**:\n- Uses `@neondatabase/serverless` package\n- Located in: `/repo/apps/todo-app/netlify/functions/db.ts`\n- Function: `getSql()` - returns neon client initialized with DATABASE_URL\n\n**Database Schema** (from `/repo/apps/todo-app/scripts/schema.ts`):\n```sql\ntodos table:\n- id: UUID (PRIMARY KEY, default: gen_random_uuid())\n- title: TEXT (NOT NULL)\n- completed: BOOLEAN (NOT NULL, default: false)\n- priority: TEXT (NOT NULL, default: 'medium')\n- due_date: DATE (nullable)\n- notes: TEXT (nullable)\n- created_at: TIMESTAMP (NOT NULL, default: NOW())\n- updated_at: TIMESTAMP (NOT NULL, default: NOW())\n```\n\n### 4. API Endpoints\n\nAll endpoints in `/repo/apps/todo-app/netlify/functions/todos.ts`:\n\n- **GET `/.netlify/functions/todos`** - Fetch all todos (sorted by created_at DESC)\n- **POST `/.netlify/functions/todos`** - Create new todo (required: title; optional: priority, due_date, notes)\n- **PUT `/.netlify/functions/todos/:id`** - Update todo with partial fields\n- **DELETE `/.netlify/functions/todos/:id`** - Delete specific todo\n- **DELETE `/.netlify/functions/todos?completed=true`** - Delete all completed todos\n\n### 5. Frontend Architecture\n\n**Framework**: React 19 with Redux Toolkit\n\n**Key Files**:\n- **`/repo/apps/todo-app/src/App.tsx`** - Root component (renders MainTodoList)\n- **`/repo/apps/todo-app/src/pages/MainTodoList.tsx`** - Main page component with:\n  - State management via Redux dispatch (fetchTodos on mount)\n  - Modal state for editing (editingTodo)\n  - All page sections: Header, AddTodo, FilterBar, SortDropdown, TodoList, EditTodoModal\n\n**Redux Store** (`/repo/apps/todo-app/src/store/`):\n- **`index.ts`** - Store configuration (todos reducer)\n- **`todosSlice.ts`** - Redux slice with:\n  - Async thunks: fetchTodos, addTodo, toggleTodo, updateTodo, deleteTodo, clearCompleted\n  - Reducers: setFilter, setSort\n  - State: items[], loading, error, filter ('all'|'active'|'completed'), sort ('newest'|'oldest'|'priority'|'due_date')\n\n**Components** (`/repo/apps/todo-app/src/components/`):\n- `Header.tsx` - Displays app title and incomplete count\n- `AddTodo.tsx` - Input for creating new todos\n- `TodoList.tsx` - Renders list of todos\n- `TodoItem.tsx` - Individual todo item\n- `FilterBar.tsx` - Filter buttons (All, Active, Completed) + Clear Completed\n- `SortDropdown.tsx` - Sort options dropdown\n- `EditTodoModal.tsx` - Modal for editing todo details\n\n**Types** (`/repo/apps/todo-app/src/types.ts`):\n```typescript\ninterface Todo {\n  id: string\n  title: string\n  completed: boolean\n  priority: 'low' | 'medium' | 'high'\n  due_date: string | null\n  notes: string | null\n  created_at: string\n  updated_at: string\n}\n\ntype FilterType = 'all' | 'active' | 'completed'\ntype SortType = 'newest' | 'oldest' | 'priority' | 'due_date'\n```\n\n### 6. Build & Deployment Configuration\n\n**Vite Config** (`/repo/apps/todo-app/vite.config.ts`):\n- React plugin enabled\n- Tailwind CSS Vite plugin\n- Source maps enabled in build\n- Minification disabled for debugging\n\n**Netlify Config** (`/repo/apps/todo-app/netlify.toml`):\n- Build: `npm run build`\n- Publish: `dist/`\n- Functions directory: `netlify/functions`\n- API redirect: `/api/*` → `/.netlify/functions/:splat`\n- SPA redirect: `/*` → `/index.html`\n\n**TypeScript Config**:\n- Target: ES2022\n- Strict mode enabled\n- JSX: react-jsx\n- Module resolution: bundler\n\n### 7. Test Specification Documents\n\n**Test Design Doc**: `/repo/apps/todo-app/docs/tests.md` (23,763 bytes)\n- 60+ detailed test cases covering:\n  - **Header** (8 tests) - title display, item count updates\n  - **AddTodo** (6 tests) - input, creation, validation\n  - **TodoList** (17 tests) - display, completion toggling, deletion, editing\n  - **FilterBar** (12 tests) - filtering, clear completed, persistence\n  - **SortDropdown** (10 tests) - sorting options and combinations\n  - **EditTodoModal** (20+ tests) - field editing, validation, save/cancel\n- Each test includes: component scope, initial state, actions, expected outcomes\n\n**App Spec**: `/repo/apps/todo-app/AppSpec.md`\n- Pages: Main Todo List Page, Edit Todo Modal\n- Data model: Todo interface\n- API endpoint specifications\n\n### 8. Test Script Documentation\n\n**Design Doc**: `/repo/skills/scripts/test.md` (122 lines)\n\n**Key Requirements**:\n1. **Entry point**: `npm run test <testFile>` (required in package.json scripts)\n2. **Neon branch management**:\n   - Kill stale netlify/vite processes\n   - Delete old test branches (matching `test-run-*` pattern)\n   - Create ephemeral branch from main\n3. **Database setup**:\n   - Run `initSchema` on new branch\n   - Run migrations\n   - Seed test data\n4. **Dev server**:\n   - Start `netlify dev` with DATABASE_URL pointing to ephemeral branch\n5. **Playwright execution**:\n   - Run with `--retries 0 --workers 1` (serial, no retries)\n   - Use Replay browser: `replayDevices['Replay Chromium']` from @replayio/playwright\n   - Use JSON reporter: `test-results/results.json`\n   - Pipe output to log file (logs/test-run-N.log)\n6. **Test result handling**:\n   - Parse results.json for pass/fail/skip counts\n   - On failure: upload one failed recording (longest duration)\n   - Parse ~/.replay/recordings.log for metadata\n7. **Cleanup**:\n   - Stop netlify dev\n   - Delete ephemeral branch\n   - Remove recordings with `npx replayio remove --all`\n8. **Output**:\n   - One-line stdout summary (e.g., \"10 passed\" or \"8 passed, 2 failed — see logs/test-run-3.log\")\n   - Full output in logs/test-run-N.log\n9. **Exit code**: Match Playwright exit code (0 for success)\n\n### 9. Key Integration Points for Test Script\n\n**Required Dependencies** (to add to package.json):\n- `@playwright/test` - Test framework\n- `@replayio/playwright` - Replay browser integration\n- `@replayio/cli` - Replay recording management\n\n**Required Environment**:\n- Node.js with tsx (already present)\n- Access to Neon API (`https://console.neon.tech/api/v2/...`)\n- Netlify CLI for dev server\n\n**Database Seeding**:\n- Use `initSchema()` from `/repo/apps/todo-app/scripts/schema.ts`\n- Implement seed script (reference pattern in `/repo/skills/debugging/seed-data.md`)\n- Reset between tests: truncate all tables and re-seed\n\n**Process Management**:\n- Kill: `netlify` and `vite` processes\n- Start: `netlify dev` with DATABASE_URL env var\n- Stop: Clean shutdown of dev server\n\n### 10. File Paths Summary\n\n```\n/repo/\n├── CLAUDE.md → Links to AGENTS.md\n├── scripts/\n│   └── add-task.ts (Task queue management)\n├── apps/todo-app/\n│   ├── package.json (scripts: dev, build, lint, check)\n│   ├── netlify.toml (build & redirect config)\n│   ├── vite.config.ts\n│   ├── tsconfig.json & tsconfig.app.json\n│   ├── scripts/\n│   │   ├── schema.ts (initSchema function)\n│   │   └── check.ts (TypeScript + ESLint)\n│   ├── docs/\n│   │   └── tests.md (60+ test cases)\n│   ├── AppSpec.md (app specification)\n│   ├── netlify/functions/\n│   │   ├── db.ts (getSql() database client)\n│   │   └── todos.ts (API endpoints)\n│   └── src/\n│       ├── App.tsx\n│       ├── main.tsx\n│       ├── types.ts\n│       ├── pages/MainTodoList.tsx\n│       ├── components/ (Header, AddTodo, TodoList, etc.)\n│       └── store/ (Redux configuration)\n├── skills/\n│   ├── AGENTS.md (Skill organization documentation)\n│   └── scripts/test.md (Test script design doc)\n```\n\n---\n\n## Summary\n\nThe todo app is a **React + Redux + Netlify** fullstack application with a PostgreSQL database (Neon). The project structure is well-organized with:\n\n1. **Clear separation** between frontend (src/), backend (netlify/functions/), and scripts\n2. **Comprehensive test specification** in `/repo/apps/todo-app/docs/tests.md` with 60+ test cases\n3. **Database utilities** in `scripts/schema.ts` for initialization\n4. **Detailed test script design** in `/repo/skills/scripts/test.md` defining exactly how the test runner should work\n5. **Environment requirements** clearly specified (Neon API key, Replay API key, DATABASE_URL, NEON_PROJECT_ID)\n6. **Reproduction capability** through ephemeral Neon branches for isolated test runs\n\nThe test script implementation should follow the specification in `/repo/skills/scripts/test.md` precisely, integrating Playwright with Replay browser, Neon database branching, and comprehensive result reporting."},{"type":"text","text":"agentId: a17e2618a02a3cd24 (for resuming to continue this agent's work if needed)\n<usage>total_tokens: 50232\ntool_uses: 43\nduration_ms: 57042</usage>"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3e708823-920f-43f5-b295-766b5a5c6f26","uuid":"09fa3aaa-ce21-463e-9699-0d69b1e04c31","tool_use_result":{"status":"completed","prompt":"I need to understand the existing project structure for implementing a test script. Please find and read the following:\n\n1. All files in /repo/scripts/ directory - list them and read their contents\n2. Read /repo/scripts/schema.ts and /repo/scripts/seed-db.ts specifically\n3. Check if there's a playwright.config.ts file in any apps/ directory\n4. Read the package.json file(s) - both root and any in apps/ directories\n5. Check for .env files in apps/ directories (just list them, note contents for DATABASE_URL and NEON_PROJECT_ID patterns)\n6. Look for any existing test files in apps/ directories\n7. Check what's in the apps/ directory structure\n\nBe thorough - read every script file in /repo/scripts/ completely.","agentId":"a17e2618a02a3cd24","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! Now I have all the information needed. Let me provide you with a comprehensive summary of the project structure.\n\n---\n\n## Project Structure Analysis for Todo App Testing\n\nBased on my thorough exploration of the repository, here's a complete breakdown of the existing project structure relevant to implementing a test script:\n\n### 1. Scripts Directory Structure\n\n**Root Scripts** (`/repo/scripts/`):\n- **`add-task.ts`** - Task queue management script that:\n  - Adds tasks to a queue file (`/repo/tasks/tasks-{CONTAINER_NAME}.json`)\n  - Uses command-line arguments: `--skill`, `--subtask`, `--app`\n  - Manages task ordering (newest tasks added to the front)\n  - Used by: `npm run add-task` in root package.json\n\n**App Scripts** (`/repo/apps/todo-app/scripts/`):\n- **`schema.ts`** - Database initialization:\n  - Uses `@neondatabase/serverless` neon() client\n  - Creates `todos` table with fields: id (UUID), title, completed, priority, due_date, notes, created_at, updated_at\n  - Creates two indexes: idx_todos_created_at, idx_todos_completed\n  - Exported function: `initSchema(databaseUrl: string)`\n\n- **`check.ts`** - Type checking and linting:\n  - Runs `npx tsc --noEmit` for TypeScript validation\n  - Runs `npx eslint . --fix` for linting\n  - Outputs to `logs/check.log`\n  - Exit code: 0 on success, 1 on failure\n\n### 2. Package.json Configuration\n\n**Root** (`/repo/package.json`):\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"app-building\",\n  \"type\": \"module\",\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"agent\": \"tsx src/agent.ts\",\n    \"add-task\": \"tsx scripts/add-task.ts\",\n    \"status\": \"tsx src/status.ts\",\n    \"read-log\": \"tsx src/read-log.ts\"\n  },\n  \"devDependencies\": {\n    \"tsx\": \"^4.19.0\",\n    \"typescript\": \"^5.5.0\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**Todo App** (`/repo/apps/todo-app/package.json`):\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"todo-app\",\n  \"type\": \"module\",\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"dev\": \"vite\",\n    \"build\": \"tsc -b && vite build\",\n    \"lint\": \"eslint .\",\n    \"preview\": \"vite preview\",\n    \"check\": \"tsx scripts/check.ts\"\n  },\n  \"devDependencies\": {\n    \"tsx\": \"^4.21.0\",\n    \"vite\": \"^7.3.1\",\n    \"tailwindcss\": \"^4.2.1\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### 3. Database Configuration\n\n**Environment Variables Required**:\n- `DATABASE_URL` - Neon database connection string (from `.env`, referenced in `/repo/apps/todo-app/netlify/functions/db.ts`)\n- `NEON_PROJECT_ID` - Neon project identifier (referenced in test documentation)\n- `NEON_API_KEY` - For Neon branch management (required for ephemeral test branches)\n- `RECORD_REPLAY_API_KEY` - For Replay recording uploads (already set in container)\n\n**Database Client**:\n- Uses `@neondatabase/serverless` package\n- Located in: `/repo/apps/todo-app/netlify/functions/db.ts`\n- Function: `getSql()` - returns neon client initialized with DATABASE_URL\n\n**Database Schema** (from `/repo/apps/todo-app/scripts/schema.ts`):\n```sql\ntodos table:\n- id: UUID (PRIMARY KEY, default: gen_random_uuid())\n- title: TEXT (NOT NULL)\n- completed: BOOLEAN (NOT NULL, default: false)\n- priority: TEXT (NOT NULL, default: 'medium')\n- due_date: DATE (nullable)\n- notes: TEXT (nullable)\n- created_at: TIMESTAMP (NOT NULL, default: NOW())\n- updated_at: TIMESTAMP (NOT NULL, default: NOW())\n```\n\n### 4. API Endpoints\n\nAll endpoints in `/repo/apps/todo-app/netlify/functions/todos.ts`:\n\n- **GET `/.netlify/functions/todos`** - Fetch all todos (sorted by created_at DESC)\n- **POST `/.netlify/functions/todos`** - Create new todo (required: title; optional: priority, due_date, notes)\n- **PUT `/.netlify/functions/todos/:id`** - Update todo with partial fields\n- **DELETE `/.netlify/functions/todos/:id`** - Delete specific todo\n- **DELETE `/.netlify/functions/todos?completed=true`** - Delete all completed todos\n\n### 5. Frontend Architecture\n\n**Framework**: React 19 with Redux Toolkit\n\n**Key Files**:\n- **`/repo/apps/todo-app/src/App.tsx`** - Root component (renders MainTodoList)\n- **`/repo/apps/todo-app/src/pages/MainTodoList.tsx`** - Main page component with:\n  - State management via Redux dispatch (fetchTodos on mount)\n  - Modal state for editing (editingTodo)\n  - All page sections: Header, AddTodo, FilterBar, SortDropdown, TodoList, EditTodoModal\n\n**Redux Store** (`/repo/apps/todo-app/src/store/`):\n- **`index.ts`** - Store configuration (todos reducer)\n- **`todosSlice.ts`** - Redux slice with:\n  - Async thunks: fetchTodos, addTodo, toggleTodo, updateTodo, deleteTodo, clearCompleted\n  - Reducers: setFilter, setSort\n  - State: items[], loading, error, filter ('all'|'active'|'completed'), sort ('newest'|'oldest'|'priority'|'due_date')\n\n**Components** (`/repo/apps/todo-app/src/components/`):\n- `Header.tsx` - Displays app title and incomplete count\n- `AddTodo.tsx` - Input for creating new todos\n- `TodoList.tsx` - Renders list of todos\n- `TodoItem.tsx` - Individual todo item\n- `FilterBar.tsx` - Filter buttons (All, Active, Completed) + Clear Completed\n- `SortDropdown.tsx` - Sort options dropdown\n- `EditTodoModal.tsx` - Modal for editing todo details\n\n**Types** (`/repo/apps/todo-app/src/types.ts`):\n```typescript\ninterface Todo {\n  id: string\n  title: string\n  completed: boolean\n  priority: 'low' | 'medium' | 'high'\n  due_date: string | null\n  notes: string | null\n  created_at: string\n  updated_at: string\n}\n\ntype FilterType = 'all' | 'active' | 'completed'\ntype SortType = 'newest' | 'oldest' | 'priority' | 'due_date'\n```\n\n### 6. Build & Deployment Configuration\n\n**Vite Config** (`/repo/apps/todo-app/vite.config.ts`):\n- React plugin enabled\n- Tailwind CSS Vite plugin\n- Source maps enabled in build\n- Minification disabled for debugging\n\n**Netlify Config** (`/repo/apps/todo-app/netlify.toml`):\n- Build: `npm run build`\n- Publish: `dist/`\n- Functions directory: `netlify/functions`\n- API redirect: `/api/*` → `/.netlify/functions/:splat`\n- SPA redirect: `/*` → `/index.html`\n\n**TypeScript Config**:\n- Target: ES2022\n- Strict mode enabled\n- JSX: react-jsx\n- Module resolution: bundler\n\n### 7. Test Specification Documents\n\n**Test Design Doc**: `/repo/apps/todo-app/docs/tests.md` (23,763 bytes)\n- 60+ detailed test cases covering:\n  - **Header** (8 tests) - title display, item count updates\n  - **AddTodo** (6 tests) - input, creation, validation\n  - **TodoList** (17 tests) - display, completion toggling, deletion, editing\n  - **FilterBar** (12 tests) - filtering, clear completed, persistence\n  - **SortDropdown** (10 tests) - sorting options and combinations\n  - **EditTodoModal** (20+ tests) - field editing, validation, save/cancel\n- Each test includes: component scope, initial state, actions, expected outcomes\n\n**App Spec**: `/repo/apps/todo-app/AppSpec.md`\n- Pages: Main Todo List Page, Edit Todo Modal\n- Data model: Todo interface\n- API endpoint specifications\n\n### 8. Test Script Documentation\n\n**Design Doc**: `/repo/skills/scripts/test.md` (122 lines)\n\n**Key Requirements**:\n1. **Entry point**: `npm run test <testFile>` (required in package.json scripts)\n2. **Neon branch management**:\n   - Kill stale netlify/vite processes\n   - Delete old test branches (matching `test-run-*` pattern)\n   - Create ephemeral branch from main\n3. **Database setup**:\n   - Run `initSchema` on new branch\n   - Run migrations\n   - Seed test data\n4. **Dev server**:\n   - Start `netlify dev` with DATABASE_URL pointing to ephemeral branch\n5. **Playwright execution**:\n   - Run with `--retries 0 --workers 1` (serial, no retries)\n   - Use Replay browser: `replayDevices['Replay Chromium']` from @replayio/playwright\n   - Use JSON reporter: `test-results/results.json`\n   - Pipe output to log file (logs/test-run-N.log)\n6. **Test result handling**:\n   - Parse results.json for pass/fail/skip counts\n   - On failure: upload one failed recording (longest duration)\n   - Parse ~/.replay/recordings.log for metadata\n7. **Cleanup**:\n   - Stop netlify dev\n   - Delete ephemeral branch\n   - Remove recordings with `npx replayio remove --all`\n8. **Output**:\n   - One-line stdout summary (e.g., \"10 passed\" or \"8 passed, 2 failed — see logs/test-run-3.log\")\n   - Full output in logs/test-run-N.log\n9. **Exit code**: Match Playwright exit code (0 for success)\n\n### 9. Key Integration Points for Test Script\n\n**Required Dependencies** (to add to package.json):\n- `@playwright/test` - Test framework\n- `@replayio/playwright` - Replay browser integration\n- `@replayio/cli` - Replay recording management\n\n**Required Environment**:\n- Node.js with tsx (already present)\n- Access to Neon API (`https://console.neon.tech/api/v2/...`)\n- Netlify CLI for dev server\n\n**Database Seeding**:\n- Use `initSchema()` from `/repo/apps/todo-app/scripts/schema.ts`\n- Implement seed script (reference pattern in `/repo/skills/debugging/seed-data.md`)\n- Reset between tests: truncate all tables and re-seed\n\n**Process Management**:\n- Kill: `netlify` and `vite` processes\n- Start: `netlify dev` with DATABASE_URL env var\n- Stop: Clean shutdown of dev server\n\n### 10. File Paths Summary\n\n```\n/repo/\n├── CLAUDE.md → Links to AGENTS.md\n├── scripts/\n│   └── add-task.ts (Task queue management)\n├── apps/todo-app/\n│   ├── package.json (scripts: dev, build, lint, check)\n│   ├── netlify.toml (build & redirect config)\n│   ├── vite.config.ts\n│   ├── tsconfig.json & tsconfig.app.json\n│   ├── scripts/\n│   │   ├── schema.ts (initSchema function)\n│   │   └── check.ts (TypeScript + ESLint)\n│   ├── docs/\n│   │   └── tests.md (60+ test cases)\n│   ├── AppSpec.md (app specification)\n│   ├── netlify/functions/\n│   │   ├── db.ts (getSql() database client)\n│   │   └── todos.ts (API endpoints)\n│   └── src/\n│       ├── App.tsx\n│       ├── main.tsx\n│       ├── types.ts\n│       ├── pages/MainTodoList.tsx\n│       ├── components/ (Header, AddTodo, TodoList, etc.)\n│       └── store/ (Redux configuration)\n├── skills/\n│   ├── AGENTS.md (Skill organization documentation)\n│   └── scripts/test.md (Test script design doc)\n```\n\n---\n\n## Summary\n\nThe todo app is a **React + Redux + Netlify** fullstack application with a PostgreSQL database (Neon). The project structure is well-organized with:\n\n1. **Clear separation** between frontend (src/), backend (netlify/functions/), and scripts\n2. **Comprehensive test specification** in `/repo/apps/todo-app/docs/tests.md` with 60+ test cases\n3. **Database utilities** in `scripts/schema.ts` for initialization\n4. **Detailed test script design** in `/repo/skills/scripts/test.md` defining exactly how the test runner should work\n5. **Environment requirements** clearly specified (Neon API key, Replay API key, DATABASE_URL, NEON_PROJECT_ID)\n6. **Reproduction capability** through ephemeral Neon branches for isolated test runs\n\nThe test script implementation should follow the specification in `/repo/skills/scripts/test.md` precisely, integrating Playwright with Replay browser, Neon database branching, and comprehensive result reporting."}],"totalDurationMs":57042,"totalTokens":50232,"totalToolUseCount":43,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":518,"cache_read_input_tokens":46282,"output_tokens":3425,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":518},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"}}}
